# Incremental local build for the myco-local container.
# Base = the CURRENT RUNNING image (myco:local-new24) so all baked runtime
# behaviour is kept; only working-tree source is overlaid to ship this
# layer:
#   - Task B: "走本机 claude / 自定义模型" on every direct Claude/Gemini call
#     site — shared server/src/local-claude.js helper (SDK query + optional
#     session gateway overlay), a 本机 Claude critic plugin
#     (server/src/critics/claude.js, selectable in the composer critic
#     dropdown), critique.js threads rec.activeGw into runCritique,
#     anthropic.js gets a localFallback (no ANTHROPIC_API_KEY → local claude)
#     for the summarizer, and btw/claude-cli + their callers pass the active
#     gateway to one-shot calls. Regression: test/local-claude-options.test.js.
#   - Run-queue agent-n2: the queue strip gains a ◓ agent-n2 button that runs
#     the next pending plan item through the DUAL-agent lane
#     (POST /sessions/:id/queue/n2 in server/src/artifacts.js →
#     compare-lanes.startN2Lane; pending → running → success). UI: app.js +
#     styles.css (.runqueue-n2-resume, cyan tint). Regression:
#     test/queue-n2-resume.test.js.
#   - CodeHub compatibility audit: all no-remote + user-level token hint
#     messages now include codehub-dg-g.huawei.com (slashcmds.js); @myco
#     follow-current-project via detectHost; regression: test/fr-codehub-
#     target.test.js.
#   - @myco follow-current-project: /fr /bug /td @myco now detectHost the
#     session's own project and file against IT (codehub/gitee/github),
#     falling back to the fixed GitHub target only when no remote resolves.
#     (server/src/slashcmds.js handleRemoteIssue).
#   - Remote-issues header/link labels route through _remoteProviderLabel
#     so gitee/codehub projects no longer render "GitHub" in the Plan view
#     (web/public/app.js); codehub no-token hint points at /setpat @codehub.
#     Regression: test/fr-codehub-target.test.js.
# (The NO_PROXY change — add 7.216.246.115 for the DS gateway — is applied at
# docker-run time, not in the image. Container creation MUST pass --add-host
# for the internal Huawei gateways — see docs/deploy.md §4.2; dropping them
# breaks in-container DNS for api.code-agent.rnd.huawei.com.)
FROM myco:local-new24
# sshpass for outbound SSH from inside sessions (Alpine repo via proxy
# build-args — HTTP_PROXY/HTTPS_PROXY/NO_PROXY passed at docker build time).
ARG HTTP_PROXY
ARG HTTPS_PROXY
ARG NO_PROXY
RUN apk add --no-cache sshpass
COPY server/src ./server/src
COPY scripts ./scripts
COPY web/public ./web/public
# docs/whatsnew — served by GET /whatsnew (server/src/index.js WHATSNEW_DIR
# resolves to /app/docs/whatsnew). Without this COPY the endpoint returns
# available:false and the "功能上新" banner never shows.
COPY docs ./docs
COPY docker/docker-entrypoint.sh /docker-entrypoint.sh
RUN chmod +x /docker-entrypoint.sh
RUN date -u +%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ > /app/web/public/build.txt
ENTRYPOINT ["/docker-entrypoint.sh"]
